            "source": [
                "# 🕵️‍♂️ Laboratorio de Consultas SQL y Auditoría G68\n",
                "\n",
                "En este notebook aprenderás a interrogar a la base de datos de sentimientos para extraer **Insights de Negocio**."
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {},
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "import sqlite3\n",
                "import pandas as pd\n",
                "import os\n",
                "\n",
                "# 1. Conexión a la base de datos generada por la API\n",
                "db_path = os.path.join(os.getcwd(), 'data', 'sentiment_history.db')\n",
                "conn = sqlite3.connect(db_path)\n",
                "\n",
                "print(\"✅ Conectado a la base de datos G68\")"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {},
            "source": [
                "## 📈 Consulta 1: El Ranking del Riesgo\n",
                "¿Cuáles son los departamentos que están afectando más la reputación del hotel?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {},
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "query = \"\"\"\n",
                "SELECT area_responsable, COUNT(*) as total_quejas\n",
                "FROM predicciones\n",
                "WHERE prevision IN ('Negativo', 'Analizado')\n",
                "GROUP BY area_responsable\n",
                "ORDER BY total_quejas DESC\n",
                "\"\"\"\n",
                "df_riesgo = pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)\n",
                "df_riesgo"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {},
            "source": [
                "## 🔍 Consulta 2: Auditoría de Explicabilidad\n",
                "Busquemos todas las menciones de 'moho' que nuestra IA detectó, para ver qué tan graves son."
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {},
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "query_moho = \"\"\"\n",
                "SELECT fecha, texto_original, explicabilidad\n",
                "FROM predicciones\n",
                "WHERE explicabilidad LIKE '%moho%'\n",
                "ORDER BY fecha DESC\n",
                "\"\"\"\n",
                "df_moho = pd.read_sql_query(query_moho, conn)\n",
                "df_moho.head()"
            ]
        },
        {
